  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STF  StrategicPlan 08-10</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Straight Talk Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">STF s&#xf6;kte st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida att genomf&#xf6;ra sin strategiska plan f&#xf6;r perioden juli-december 2009 d&#xe5; det saknades finansiella resurser f&#xf6;r detta. Detta &#xe4;r det sista ekonomiska bidraget till STF fr&#xe5;n Sida. Fr&#xe5;n 2010 kommer medel kanaliseras via CSF.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Straight Talk requested Sida to fund its activities from July to December 2009,strategic plan 2008-2010. STF had a financial gap for this period. This is the last contribution to Straight Talk by Sida. From 2010, Sida will channel with other donors earmarked funds to the Civil Society Fund of the Uganda AIDS Commission. This is in support to address the national HIV/AIDS response in a morecoordinated manner</narrative>
  </description>
